tch. But which one is described as \"American animated television series based on the DC Comics fictional superhero team, the 'Teen Titans'?\" The evidence for \"Teen Titans Go!\" uses that exact phrase. The evidence for \"Teen Titans\" uses \"based on the DC comics series of the same name\". The question includes the phrase \"based on the DC Comics fictional superhero team, the \\\"Teen Titans\\\"\". That's exactly the phrasing used for \"Teen Titans Go!\". So answer likely \"Teen Titans Go!\". However Tara Strong's major voice role includes \"Teen Titans\" (original) and \"Teen Titans Go!\". Which one is being asked? The phrase matches \"Teen Titans Go!\" description. So answer: Teen Titans Go!\n\nProvide citation: from Tara Strong evidence line showing \"Teen Titans Go!\" as major voice role, and from Teen Titans Go! description showing it's an American animated television series based on the DC Comics fictional superhero team. Need two citations: one for Tara Strong major voice role includes \"Teen Titans Go!\", and one for description of Teen Titans Go! as American animated series based on DC Comics team.\n\nCitations: Tara Strong (title \"Tara Strong\") sentence 1 includes \"Teen Titans Go!\". That's sentence_id 1. Also \"Teen Titans Go! (TV series)\" sentence 0 or 1 includes description. Use \"Teen Titans Go! (TV series)\" sentence 0: \"Teen Titans Go! is an American animated television series based on the DC Comics fictional superhero team, the \\\"Teen Titans\\\".\" That's sentence_id 0.\n\nReturn JSON."},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":1396,"completion_tokens":722,"total_tokens":2118,"audio_prompt_tokens":0},"created":1791975801,"object":"chat.completion","prompt_filter_results":null}